## Get posts (default limit=10, page=1) - expect 200
GET http://localhost:3000/posts

###
## Get posts with pagination - expect 200
GET http://localhost:3000/posts?limit=5&page=1

###
## limit above 100 (@Max(100)) - expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/posts?limit=500

###
## Get post by id - expect 200 (or 404 if it doesn't exist)
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/1

###
## Unknown post id - expect 404
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/999

###
## Non-numeric id (ParseIntPipe) - expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/abc

###
## Get posts by user id - expect 200 ([] if the user has no posts)
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/user/1

###
## Posts of an unknown user - expect 404
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/user/999

###
## Non-numeric user id (ParseIntPipe) - expect 400
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/user/abc
